5,1,1,talk,May,,I want to make sure we don't just repeat the same mistake. Who is actually carrying the weight here?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""May"",""self"":true,""raw"":""May: I want to make sure we don't just repeat the same mistake. Who is actually carrying the weight here?""}]}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We need to see the actual numbers before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the costs too. We need to know exactly what this setup will cost each of us, not just guess.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry less about the money and more about whether we can still be neighbors after this.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I have watched this lane for decades. We must measure the true cost in time and spirit, not just yen, before we bind ourselves.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, your worry about the budget is valid, but I need to know who is physically doing the work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the physical work is part of it, but I am more concerned about the daily reality of living beside it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, I’m checking the block ledger to see what we’ve already spent on fixes. It’s a start.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that sounds like a good start. I’m hoping we can find a way to keep the peace while we sort out the details.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the ledger shows the yen, but I need to know the hours. What does the daily upkeep actually demand of us?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, hours matter, but I need to know who is stuck with the gate. I’m checking the complaint log to see who has been suffering","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the complaint log tells us who is angry, but I need to know what the daily reality feels like. I am checking the supervised mornings.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, that sounds interesting. I’m also checking the ward subsidy to see if we can get some help with the costs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, I appreciate that. I’m checking the station block’s minutes to see how their arrangement actually played out for them.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@May, the log shows anger, but I need the hours. I am checking the supervised mornings to see the true daily burden.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"@Midori, I hope their minutes show they kept the peace. I am checking the measurements of the five frontages to see who actually has room.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the measurements show space, but I need to know the smell. I am checking the station block’s bin house to see the reality.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@May, the measurements are useful, but I need to know the rules. I am checking the ward filing requirements to see what is actually allowed.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the rules are important, but I am checking the statements at the residents' meeting to see if we can actually trust each other to follow them.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the rules are the skeleton, but I need the muscle. I am checking the truck arrival time to see when the real work begins.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
