35,2,1,talk,May,,"@Kenji, I found the complaint log. Eleven of fourteen complaints came from the gate household. That’s not a shared burden, it’s a target.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @May, that confirms the imbalance. I checked the station block’s bin house; the smell is worse than the open pile.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@May, that’s harsh. I checked the subsidy; it only covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand. We still pay the rest.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that’s a heavy lift. I checked the station block’s minutes; they were arguing over sweeping within two years.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: @Kenji, that’s a heavy lift. I checked the station block’s minutes; they were arguing over sweeping within two years.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the subsidy is a small comfort. I checked the truck time; it arrives before many of us wake, making the window impossible.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, if the truck comes before we wake, how do we even manage the window? I’m checking the frontages to see who has space.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, the frontages show two houses have room, but one is blocked by a driveway. We need a plan that fits the space, not just the budget.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, space is tight. I checked the filing rules; a permanent build needs five signatures and four months. That’s a long wait.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, four months is a long time to wait. I checked the residents' meeting; three people refused to turn away late bags.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, that refusal is the heart of the matter. I checked the supervised mornings; each takes fifty minutes. We must plan for that shared burden.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, fifty minutes a morning is a lot. I checked the frontages; the narrowest leaves only ninety centimetres. We can’t just assume everyone has room.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, ninety centimetres is a trap. I checked the supervised mornings; fifty minutes each means twenty per house yearly. That is the true cost.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, twenty mornings is manageable, but the filing rules are the real hurdle. A permanent build needs four months and five signatures.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, four months is a long time to wait. I checked the residents' meeting; three people refused to turn away late bags.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, their refusal is the danger. I checked the truck time; it arrives before we wake. We cannot enforce a window that starts in the dark.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"@Servas, if the window is impossible, we can’t rely on it. I’m looking at the frontages to see who actually has space for a rotation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, space is only half the story. I checked the bin house; the smell is worse than the open pile. We need a solution that doesn’t just move the problem.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, the smell is a real problem. But I checked the filing rules; moving the point needs its own notice every time. That’s a lot of paperwork.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the paperwork is a burden, but the trust is the real test. I checked the residents' meeting; nobody volunteered to enforce the rules.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, trust is fragile, but the clock is not. The truck arrives before dawn, making any supervised window a nightmare. We must choose a path that respects our sleep.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
