60,3,1,talk,May,,"@Kenji, the paperwork for moving is heavy, but the gate household’s pain is heavier. I’m leaning toward rotating the location to share the burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, rotation ignores the smell. The bin house proved enclosed structures make it worse. I oppose any permanent build.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, you’re right about the smell. But the subsidy helps with the build, and the filing rules are just paperwork. I’m leaning toward the enclosed structure.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the subsidy helps, but the minutes show they argued over sweeping within two years. I worry a permanent build will just create new friction.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the subsidy is a drop in the ocean. The truck arrives before dawn, making supervised windows impossible. I oppose any plan that demands our sleep.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, the subsidy is a drop in the ocean. The truck arrives before dawn, making supervised windows impossible. I oppose any plan that demands our sleep.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, you are repeating Servas. I stand by my objection to the enclosure. The smell is the deciding factor for me.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I hear you on the smell, but the ledger shows we bleed money on open bags. The enclosure stops that. I’m voting for the structure.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the ledger shows the cost, but the minutes show the cost to our friendship. I cannot vote for a structure that guarantees we will stop speaking.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the ledger shows the yen, but the truck shows the hours. I cannot vote for a structure that demands our sleep.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, the ledger is a leak, but the gate household is drowning. I am voting for the rotation to finally share the burden.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, rotation moves the smell, it does not fix it. I am voting for the managed hours, despite the early start.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I hear you, but the smell is worse in a box. I’m voting for the rotation to share the burden fairly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, I hear your fairness, but the minutes show permanent structures breed conflict. I am voting for the rotation to keep our peace.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the rotation respects our sleep and shares the burden. I am voting for the rotation to preserve our peace.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,May,,"@Kenji, I am glad we are aligned. The rotation is the only path that respects both our budgets and our sleep. I am voting for the rotation.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, I stand by my vote for managed hours. The smell is the deciding factor for me, and I cannot support moving it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I understand your worry, but the rotation spreads the load. I am voting for the rotation to keep us neighbors.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, I respect your caution, but the rotation keeps us talking. I am voting for the rotation to preserve our peace.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,"@Mizuki, your caution is wise, but the rotation respects our sleep and shares the burden. I am voting for the rotation to preserve our peace.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
